[ar:Aarav Kharade]
[ti:Who I Wanted To Be]

[00:03.19]Maybe I'm not who you wanted
[00:06.91]Maybe I'm not what you see
[00:11.37]But have you ever stopped for a moment
[00:15.97]To find out who I wanted to be?
[00:21.75]Every time I sing, there's something wrong
[00:23.82]Every time I speak, I don't belong
[00:25.88]You hear one note, say I sound so bad
[00:28.28]You see one side, say I'm all I have
[00:30.60]You judge my words, you judge my ways
[00:32.98]Turn all my nights into brighter days?
[00:35.20]No, you just tell me what I should change
[00:37.44]Like being myself is something strange
[00:39.92]I try so hard, but you don't see
[00:42.04]The person that I'm trying to be
[00:44.37]You count the cracks, ignore the light
[00:46.45]And somehow I'm the one who isn't right
[00:48.92]You say I'm young, I don't understand
[00:51.15]Like I can't have dreams of my own in my hands
[00:53.44]You call it a lesson, you call it the truth
[00:56.02]But you never see what your words put me through
[00:58.17]Who I wanted to be
[01:00.49]Is that so hard to see?
[01:02.74]You keep telling me what's wrong with me
[01:04.82]But there's so much more than what you see
[01:07.34]You point your fingers, you call it my fault
[01:09.92]You build up the walls, then blame me for it all
[01:11.95]I'm not just the mistakes you see
[01:14.26]I'm so much more than you think of me
[01:16.62]Who I wanted to be
[01:18.92]Who I wanted to be
[01:21.00]You keep telling me who I should become
[01:23.07]But you never ask me who I want to be
[01:26.15]Oh-oh, can't you see?
[01:28.42]There's a whole other side of me
[01:30.81]Oh-oh, let me breathe
[01:33.14]Let me be who I want to be
[01:35.52]I'm thirteen, still learning how to grow
[01:37.92]Still finding things that I don't even know
[01:39.95]You say I'm childish, say I lack sense
[01:42.42]Like growing up means I can't feel this
[01:44.72]You choose the things that matter to you
[01:46.72]Then wonder why I don't want them too
[01:49.12]You never ask what makes me smile
[01:51.21]Just tell me I'm wasting all my time
[01:53.75]And maybe I mess up, maybe I fall
[01:56.09]Maybe I don't have the answers at all
[01:58.13]But how can I learn, how can I try
[02:00.30]When every mistake becomes another reason why?
[02:02.78]You say that I'm wrong, before I explain
[02:05.00]You leave me with the guilt, but never the space
[02:07.28]To show you the things that I do right
[02:09.45]The little sparks that I keep inside
[02:11.57]You say I'm young, I don't understand
[02:13.82]But I've got my own dreams, I've got my own plans
[02:15.82]I'm not asking you to agree with me
[02:17.97]Just don't close your eyes to the rest of me
[02:20.40]Who I wanted to be
[02:22.79]Is that so hard to see?
[02:25.06]You keep telling me what's wrong with me
[02:27.10]But there's so much more than what you see
[02:29.47]You point your fingers, you call it my fault
[02:31.63]You build up the walls, then blame me for it all
[02:34.00]I'm not just the mistakes you see
[02:36.28]I'm so much more than you think of me
[02:38.59]Who I wanted to be
[02:40.90]Who I wanted to be
[02:43.12]You keep telling me who I should become
[02:45.23]But you never ask me who I want to be
[02:48.86]Maybe my singing isn't perfect
[02:51.45]Maybe I don't always get things right
[02:53.47]Maybe there's a lot that I am learning
[02:55.55]Maybe I'm still figuring out my life
[02:57.97]But does that mean my dreams mean nothing?
[03:00.28]Does that mean my voice should disappear?
[03:02.67]I'm not asking you to call me perfect
[03:04.55]I'm just asking you to really hear
[03:07.18]There's a side of me you never notice
[03:09.57]There's a heart beneath the things I lack
[03:11.67]You keep looking for a reason to correct me
[03:13.82]But when will you look for something good in me?
[03:16.93]I'm still growing
[03:17.87]I'm still trying
[03:19.18]I'm still dreaming
[03:20.40]I'm still fighting
[03:21.62]Not to be the person you imagined
[03:23.49]Not to fit the shape you made for me
[03:25.69]I just want the chance to find the answer
[03:30.64]To who I am, and who I want to be
[03:35.11]Who I wanted to be
[03:36.57]I wish that you could see
[03:38.94]There's more to me than every little flaw
[03:41.20]More than every time I break a rule
[03:43.64]You point your fingers, say it's all my fault
[03:45.80]But I won't let your words define it all
[03:48.07]I'm not just the mistakes you see
[03:50.35]I'm still becoming all that I can be
[03:53.25]Who I wanted to be
[03:55.17]There's so much more inside of me
[03:57.50]You keep telling me who I should become
[03:59.85]But I'm the one who has to live that life
[04:07.20]Maybe I'm not who you wanted
[04:09.50]Maybe I'm still learning to see
[04:13.96]But I'm not just the person you criticize...
[04:20.08]I'm still becoming
[04:24.04]Who I wanted to be.
[04:29.01]Who I wanted to be.
[04:33.88]Who I wanted To be.